{"speciesId":733,"names":{"fr":"Bazoucan","es":"Toucannon","en":"Toucannon","ja":"ドデカバシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Pendant le combat, son bec chauffe et dépasse allègrement les 100 °C. Ses adversaires repartent généralement avec de graves brûlures."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando va a combatir, calienta su pico hasta temperaturas que superan los 100 °C, lo que puede causar graves quemaduras al contacto."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it battles, its beak heats up. The temperature can easily exceed 212 degrees Fahrenheit, causing severe burns when it hits."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"クチバシを 発熱させ 戦う。 その温度は １００度を 優に 超え 突かれるだけで 大火傷。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il fait exploser ses gaz digestifs pour propulser les pépins qu’il a dans le bec, avec une force capable de réduire en miettes de gros rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Hace estallar los gases de su interior para disparar semillas por el pico con una potencia capaz de pulverizar rocas enormes."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Within its beak, its internal gas ignites, explosively launching seeds with enough power to pulverize boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"体内の ガスを クチバシの 中で 爆発させ 木のタネを 発射。 大岩も 粉々にする パワー。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ils communiquent entre eux en se frappant mutuellement sur le bec. La force et la cadence des coups en disent long sur leur état d’esprit."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se comunican con sus compañeros chocando los picos. El número de veces y la fuerza con la que lo hacen transmiten sus distintos sentimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They smack beaks with others of their kind to communicate. The strength and number of hits tell each other how they feel."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"仲間と クチバシを 叩き合わせて コミュニケーション。 叩く 強さや 回数で 気持ちを 伝えあう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les couples de Bazoucan sont réputés pour leur harmonie. On en amène souvent aux mariages pour porter bonheur aux jeunes époux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Las parejas de Toucannon son famosas por la armonía que reina entre ellas. Por eso se llevan a las bodas como portadores de buena fortuna."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Known for forming harmonious couples, this Pokémon is brought to wedding ceremonies as a good luck charm."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"番いが 仲睦まじいことで 知られる。 縁起物 の 代わりに 結婚式に 連れて こられる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":733,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[25,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"drill-peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",34],[18,"level-up",34],[25,"level-up",34],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[17,"level-up",30],[18,"level-up",30],[25,"level-up",30],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sky-attack","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"egg",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[17,"machine